# Pidlwick II travelling with the party (docs/voice/pidlwick_ii.md): short lines a guest says while walking with the party, shown and voiced
# like banter (story/banter.gd). The node's name says when it may play: quest_ on entering an area while their story is
# at that point (these come first), place_ on entering an area, fight_ after a won fight, idle_ now and then on the
# road. Each plays once per playthrough, only while Pidlwick II is with the party. Every line here is unvoiced for now.

~ quest_sorry
if guest:pidlwick_ii and flag.pidlwick_truth_known
interject guest:pidlwick_ii: SORRY ABOUT THE STAIRS. I SAY IT EVERY DAY. NOBODY HEARS.
endif
-> END

~ place_castle
if guest:pidlwick_ii and region:castle_ravenloft
interject guest:pidlwick_ii: HOME. NOT HOME. DO NOT LEAN ON THE RAILS.
endif
-> END

~ place_toy_shop
if guest:pidlwick_ii and at:vallaki_blinsky_toys
interject guest:pidlwick_ii: TOY SHOP. NICE MAN. I WILL NOT TOUCH. I WILL LOOK VERY HARD.
endif
-> END

~ place_road
if guest:pidlwick_ii and region:svalich_road
interject guest:pidlwick_ii: TREES. SO MANY. NOBODY SAID.
endif
-> END

~ fight_helped
if guest:pidlwick_ii
interject guest:pidlwick_ii: I HELPED. DID I HELP? I HELPED.
endif
-> END

~ fight_behind
if guest:pidlwick_ii
interject guest:pidlwick_ii: I KEPT BEHIND. ALWAYS BEHIND. PROMISE KEPT.
endif
-> END

~ fight_wind
if guest:pidlwick_ii
interject guest:pidlwick_ii: WIND ME PLEASE. A LITTLE. THANK YOU.
endif
-> END

~ idle_play
if guest:pidlwick_ii
interject guest:pidlwick_ii: PLAY? LATER. LATER IS FINE.
endif
-> END

~ idle_stairs
if guest:pidlwick_ii
interject guest:pidlwick_ii: STAIRS. I COUNT THEM. YOU COUNT THEM TOO. SAFER.
endif
-> END
